      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Re-visiting this thread. Having In Room users on a Wing to have on the side may prove useful if you're hosting a Group+ or a Group Public instance to moderate, and you can continue to use your Quick Menu while it's open on other tabs.\n\nAgain, while the Here tab proves useful, having another option may also work for other users, depending on preference.",
